{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30861","headline":"题石瓮寺 · 马戴","name":"题石瓮寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧室并皇宫，云门辇路同。\n渭分双阙北，山迥五陵东。\n修绠悬林表，深泉汲洞中。\n人烟窥垤蚁，鸳瓦拂冥鸿。\n藓壁松生峭，龛灯月照空。\n稀逢息心侣，独礼竺乾公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}